    {
      "source": "<dt>Parameters:</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>value</code></a> to write; can be null.</dd>\n<dd><code>target</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> of value to be written; must not be null.</dd>\n<dt>Returns:</dt>\n<dd>can be null.</dd>\n<dt>Throws:</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - if value cannot be written as an instance of <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>.</dd>\n<dt>See Also:</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"#write(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>write(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "translation": "<dt>参数：</dt>\n<dd><code>value</code> - 要写入的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Object.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>value</code></a>；可为 null。</dd>\n<dd><code>target</code> - 要写入值的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a>；不能为 null。</dd>\n<dt>返回：</dt>\n<dd>可为 null。</dd>\n<dt>抛出：</dt>\n<dd><code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/IllegalStateException.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">IllegalStateException</a></code> - 如果 value 无法作为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Class.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>type</code></a> 的实例进行写入。</dd>\n<dt>参见：</dt>\n<dd>\n<ul class=\"tag-list-long\">\n<li><a href=\"#write(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.data.core.TypeInformation)\"><code>write(Object, TypeInformation)</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"../core/TypeInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.core\"><code>TypeInformation</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
